  "text": "American Vet Center | Trusted Pet Clinic in Cairo and Alexandria\ntop of page\nVIEW ALL LOCATIONS\nLocation\nOPEN DAILY - WALK-INS WELCOME - APPOINTMENTS VIA WHATSAPP OR PHONE\nHome\nServices\nAbout us\nContact\nLocations\nZamalek\nMaadi\nSheikh Zayed\nSheraton\nRehab (New Cairo)\nFAQ's\nMembers\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nMail\na.v.c.1@hotmail.com\n@americanvetcenter\nServing Cairo and Alexandria, with clinics in Zamalek, Sheikh Zayed, Sheraton, Ma’adi, and New Cairo\nWelcome to\nAmerican Veterinary Center\nYour Pet’s Health is in Good Hands\nOur Services\nOPENING HOURS\n24 HOURS 7 DAYS\nEmergency Care:\n10:00 pm - 10:00 am\nCONTACT US\na.v.c.1@hotmail.com\nMail\nHOTLINE:\n+201210826108​\nPhone\nLocations\n▪️ZAMALEK : 30 EL GEZIRA EL WOSTA —  01110801801 -- (02)27376664/8\n▪️MAADI : 11C, 199 ST., DEGLA — 01110803803 -- 01210814356 -- (02) 25177266\n▪️ZAYED : DISTRICT 13, 1ST NEIGHBOURHOOD, ST 12 — 01110802802 -- 01210813869 -- (02) 38956948\n▪️SHERATON : 2 EL SHAHEED MAHMOUD ESMAT HAMDY — 01060300853 -- 01210813549 -- (02) 22666996\n▪️NEW CAIRO : B60 EASTERN MARKET, EL REHAB 2 — 01118848190 -- 01210813687\nSohair El-Geziry\nThe center's atmosphere is professional and friendly. The vets have a lot of experience and it's clear that they work hard and love what they do; very patient, as well, as they pay attention to every detail we mention and are very knowledgeable. Definitely recommended👍\nHazel Cortez\nAmerican Vet Center in Zamalek truly stands out as a sanctuary for pets and their owners. The team of doctors is nothing short of extraordinary. They are not only highly professional but also deeply compassionate, showing genuine care for every animal that comes through their doors. Whether it’s a routine check-up or an emergency, you can see their passion and dedication in the way they handle each case with expertise and kindness.\nThe clinic itself is immaculate, setting a new standard for cleanliness and hygiene. Every piece of equipment and tool they use is spotless, ensuring the highest level of safety and comfort for your pets. It’s evident that they prioritize both the health of the animals and the peace of mind of their owners.\nWhat makes American Vet Center truly special is their ability to combine professionalism with a heartfelt love for animals. You can trust that your furry friends are in the best hands possible. Highly recommended for anyone seeking top-notch veterinary care in Zamalek.\nJimmy Elshazly\nThanks to the AVC team in Maadi for saving my cat’s life. I truly appreciate their professionalism and highly recommend them to anyone who cares about his furry pet.\nChat with us on Whatsapp\nCall\n+201210826108\nPhone\nTerms and Conditions\nEmail\na.v.c.1@hotmail.com\nMail\nPrivacy Policy\nFollow\namericanvetcenter\nFAQ's\nbottom of page",
